# Figma Design System Rules

Source of truth: Figma file `Pawan-Bisht-s-team-library`  
Homepage frame: `react-form-toaster-homepage` (`node-id=413-4`, fileKey `StAOKch0NHvKh5HgDHfsKl`).

Before coding from Figma: load `figma-design-to-code`, call `get_design_context`, treat output as REFERENCE — adapt to this stack, never paste Figma Tailwind verbatim.

## 1. Tokens

Defined in `src/index.css` via Tailwind v4 `@theme`. Do not invent new colors/fonts.

| Token | Value | Use |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `page` | `#090a0f` | Page background |
| `page-alt` | `#0b0d15` | Alternating sections |
| `surface` | `#11131e` | Cards / panels |
| `surface-raised` | `#131622` | Panel headers |
| `surface-input` | `#181b2b` | Inputs |
| `border` | `#1d2138` | Default 1px borders |
| `border-strong` | `#2d3356` | Emphasized cards |
| `text` | `#f1f2f6` | Headings / primary |
| `muted` | `#8f95b2` | Body / labels |
| `faint` | `#4e5474` | Hints / placeholders |
| `accent` | `#5d5fef` | Primary CTA / focus |
| `pink` | `#ef5da8` | Secondary badge accent |
| `success` / `success-bg` | `#10b981` / `#1c382a` | Success toast |
| `danger` | `#ef4444` | Field errors |

Typography: **Work Sans only** (`font-sans`). Weights: 400 / 500 / 600 / 700 / 800.  
Hero H1: `48px` / extrabold / `leading-[1.15]` / `tracking-[-1.44px]`.  
Section H2: `32px` extrabold. Labels: `12px` semibold muted.

```css
/* src/index.css — extend tokens here, then use Tailwind classes */
@theme {
  --font-sans: "Work Sans", ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif;
  --color-accent: #5d5fef;
}
```

## 2. Components

| Layer | Path | Rule |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Primitives | `src/components/ui/*` | Badge, Button, CodePanel, Container, FeatureCard… |
| Form chrome | `src/components/ui/form/*` | Inline inputs / toast matching Figma |
| Layout | `src/components/layout/*` | Navbar, Footer, SiteLayout |
| Sections | `src/components/sections/*` | One section = one job; data-driven |
| Demos | `src/components/demos/*` | Live examples |
| Content | `src/data/*.ts` | Copy/cards — edit data, not JSX |

Reuse existing primitives. Do not recreate buttons/cards/badges.

## 3. Stack

- React 19 + TypeScript + Vite 8
- Tailwind CSS v4 (`@tailwindcss/vite`)
- `react-router-dom` for `/`, `/docs`, `/playground`
- `react-form-toaster` **only** for Playground modal demos (`Formbox`)
- `zod` for validation
- `lucide-react` for icons (explicit `size-*`, stroke ~1.75–2)

Alias: `@/` → `src/`.

## 4. Assets

- Static: `public/` (e.g. `public/brand-logo.svg`)
- Brand mark path: `site.logoSrc` in `src/data/site.ts`
- Figma MCP asset URLs expire (~7 days) — download to `public/` before shipping
- No CDN

## 5. Icons

- Prefer `lucide-react` matching Figma glyph names (`LayoutGrid`, `ShieldCheck`, `Zap`, `CloudUpload`, `CheckCircle2`)
- Brand: `<img src={site.logoSrc} />` — never CircleX placeholder long-term
- GitHub: `src/components/ui/GitHubIcon.tsx`
- Size leaves explicitly (`size-4`, `size-[18px]`) — no stretch

## 6. Styling

- Utility-first Tailwind with design tokens (`bg-page`, `border-border`, `text-muted`)
- Global base in `src/index.css` only
- Radius: inputs `rounded-md` (6px), cards `rounded-xl` (12px), badges `rounded-full`
- Borders: `1px solid` token colors — never thick glows / white/10 glass unless Figma says so
- Responsive: mobile-first; `Container` = `max-w-[1440px]` + `px-5 sm:px-8 lg:px-20`
- **Forbidden:** macOS traffic-light dots; purple glow orbs; gradient headline text; glass pill nav; Inter/Roboto/system as primary

## 7. Project structure

```
src/
  components/{ui,ui/form,layout,sections,demos}/
  data/{site,homepage}.ts
  pages/{Home,Docs,Playground}Page.tsx
  App.tsx  # routes
```

Data-driven homepage: change `src/data/homepage.ts` / `site.ts` for copy. Sections map 1:1 to Figma frames.

## 8. Formbox vs inline

| Surface | Use |
| --- | --- |
| Hero / inline demos | Custom form in `ui/form` + Zod — **never** `Formbox` (it is a modal) |
| `/playground` | Real `Formbox` modal from `react-form-toaster` |

## 9. Figma MCP checklist

1. Parse URL → `fileKey` + `nodeId` (`413-4` → `413:4`)
2. `get_design_context` with `skillNames: resource:figma-design-to-code`
3. Map hex → `@theme` tokens; map fonts → Work Sans
4. Reuse `ui/*` before new components
5. No mac window controls in `CodePanel` or demos
6. Verify against Figma screenshot (borders, type sizes, toast)

## 10. Anti-patterns

```tsx
// ❌ Modal Formbox in hero
<Formbox open={open} ... />

// ✅ Inline playable form
<form onSubmit={...}><FormField ... /></form>

// ❌ Traffic lights
<span className="rounded-full bg-red-500" />

// ❌ Glow restyle
<div className="blur-[130px] bg-indigo-600/20" />
```
